| best Task F baseline (same-hour 7-day mean) | {{p3f_same_hour_mean_7d_rmse}} | {{p3f_same_hour_mean_7d_r2}} |
| LightGBM, static only | {{taskf_static_only_rmse}} | {{taskf_static_only_r2}} |
